    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Maru",
      "key": "summer_Sat",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, have any interesting farm stories to tell me?#$e#Guess not.",
      "translation": "Hej, nemáš pro mě nějakou zajímavou historku z farmy?#$e#Tak asi ne.",
      "sourceSHA256": "e05d59f0ad9bd3922e9d58b38797786740b8746a42ef524ba9c8766c9cb2a1d7",
      "translationSHA256": "04b5a9929c4d4ac1c58c84a041b89d6da5739536bb3b0b86e48bebffb3b158f1",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Maru",
      "key": "summer_Fri",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I worked at the clinic yesterday. We didn't have a single patient.#$e#I guess people get sick less during summer.",
      "translation": "Včera jsem pracovala na klinice. Neměli jsme ani jednoho pacienta.#$e#Lidé asi v létě stonají méně.",
      "sourceSHA256": "523463be22e6871386e0ef0a080c33e83143e9adbd1c19d02b1e53799e4b30b7",
      "translationSHA256": "4e15d1a9019f79b65175958393e3ad9a8a45b9f7b2c9fa98452e86c3a297c6cc",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Maru",
      "key": "summer_Sun",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I bet you're growing some interesting crops right now.#$b#Dad says a lot of exotic plants grow in the valley this time of year.",
      "translation": "Vsadím se, že právě teď pěstuješ nějaké zajímavé plodiny.#$b#Táta říká, že v tomto období roste v údolí spousta exotických rostlin.",
      "sourceSHA256": "eb2d64eeb3ff1071621d0d7e9cd9f37c89745e0016e0cfd02f8ec3c71c0796af",
      "translationSHA256": "1677799bc60c9890e10a43ad00fc94e21ce53083db1d3d0162824801d648ae15",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Maru",
      "key": "summer_Fri2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, tell me a story about farming.#$e#That's really interesting!",
      "translation": "Hej, pověz mi nějakou historku z farmy.#$e#To je opravdu zajímavé!",
      "sourceSHA256": "9218f8813111b03d89dad720f99de6b8c03adfcb8e6d656f13a430ef017de2ed",
      "translationSHA256": "b05f92aeb636a882856ce95d08a64f9a30c61c530e6026480d0ba705d3849cb0",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Maru",
      "key": "summer_Wed2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Is it just me or did it suddenly get really hot?#$e#I guess it's just me.",
      "translation": "Zdá se to jen mně, nebo se tu najednou udělalo pořádné horko?#$e#Asi je horko jen mně.",
      "sourceSHA256": "a0093cc94d6c0e78e9c563437a0d059a5a79207d4154065824b702b112fd6c98",
      "translationSHA256": "62a5ad0700b6e7a4507e77707b98b9763045914b118a010d15ee7404dabc4a0d",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Maru",
      "key": "summer_Sun6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Some day I'm going to be a world-class inventor.$u#$e#You're lucky to be friends with me!#$b#...just kidding.",
      "translation": "Jednou ze mě bude vynálezkyně světové úrovně.$u#$e#Máš štěstí, že se mnou kamarádíš!#$b#... Jen si dělám legraci.",
      "sourceSHA256": "6f1c28ce3868f047f60563dcadf80edc5390ce7ecf4a85877d69c5ed9a86fc84",
      "translationSHA256": "96547405e224106f3067e4bf66d84c5530c086b31186ac33600b2571be4eea29",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Maru",
      "key": "summer_Tue8",
      "field": null,
      "source": "@, you're looking sharp today.$h",
      "translation": "@, dnes ti to opravdu sluší.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "7c6a8526040c12e382e13cde693324316c028f2b3033c7608f8e11d1cd8557cd",
      "translationSHA256": "d8d693659691be03bc2cb9dc34d5a5ba7a09367d33dd012fdda9bfd15a8a2d2b",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
