    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Maru",
      "key": "fall_Mon",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Have you explored the mines much? I've heard you can find some useful materials there.",
      "translation": "Máš už Doly pořádně prozkoumané? Slyšela jsem, že se tam dají najít užitečné materiály.",
      "sourceSHA256": "d770c926a63ec4082e9c059e44cbdac335eb95f360ec825f558f5574d5e70b03",
      "translationSHA256": "aaa54d056aee101ca00d250888ba0c9facdb4483cfd96914a677e307862cc62a",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Maru",
      "key": "fall_Tue",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The trees look beautiful today!$h",
      "translation": "Stromy dnes vypadají nádherně!$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "c44a7caed4fd6b6038b703b0e08f06f5a44815ef14af899c49f115027cce94bc",
      "translationSHA256": "c01d6562e86ea6542fa83125e2182ee6e39fc5e3e9b56f3370155d2f6ad6ee02",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Maru",
      "key": "fall_Thu",
      "field": null,
      "source": "In other parts of the world it's spring right now. Imagine that!",
      "translation": "V jiných částech světa je právě teď jaro. Jen si to představ!",
      "sourceSHA256": "0983e7caee9247d4e209097e0564c6bb56866355203de1a2dc9c18e5293f11b4",
      "translationSHA256": "ed9155328bece7e632dfb7797b36aa557f1ed0b54ba51d70ad881e3488776ea0",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Maru",
      "key": "fall_Wed",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Bleh... I don't feel like working tomorrow.",
      "translation": "Blé... Zítra se mi nechce do práce.",
      "sourceSHA256": "79a257779716a43b991c37925cf8b4863d27e87e89c55999be641e39ea533db3",
      "translationSHA256": "0b1c3bd60742d57f4a48364d08da6f10027c0e2c4735c6e0fabe270293b1446b",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Maru",
      "key": "fall_Fri",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I bet we'll start seeing more people at the clinic this season.$s#$e#I hope everyone stays healthy.",
      "translation": "Vsadím se, že v tomhle období začne na kliniku chodit víc lidí.$s#$e#Doufám, že všichni zůstanou zdraví.",
      "sourceSHA256": "d481a29a208b7d8ce77a193b41c42ac325fa62f7202433f6192630d23a7ef150",
      "translationSHA256": "243b1985f27bd44290c0bd532502532fbcb3de03b49d30b8730c8ce5f62b9f49",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Maru",
      "key": "fall_Sat",
      "field": null,
      "source": "All these falling leaves will provide food for mushrooms and other small organisms.$u#$e#Interesting, isn't it?",
      "translation": "Všechno to spadané listí poskytne potravu houbám a dalším drobným organismům.$u#$e#Zajímavé, viď?",
      "sourceSHA256": "c7202d15159afac1912f0d844878de0eec3deee20587ee39766bdd2401ab5523",
      "translationSHA256": "b414700d4a865cbc092a76d8ed32ea27b9b3686b0a8c605a8901c22d0c726975",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Maru",
      "key": "fall_Sun",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, here's to another good week! *toast*",
      "translation": "Hej, připijme si na další dobrý týden! *připíjí*",
      "sourceSHA256": "967b60c0de845c386f6bf0860b69ff20c93901773006a48ebcbe7559d7df2051",
      "translationSHA256": "48c9f40461226adefeecc47c1c7773e45246b2d3127d6744565d937921c58c08",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Maru",
      "key": "fall_Tue2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "@, I just love how the trees look right now!#$e#I know you like them too.",
      "translation": "@, moc se mi líbí, jak teď stromy vypadají!#$e#Vím, že se líbí i tobě.",
      "sourceSHA256": "aba4c48a2aaaedc7e1d42987a0748b6f1c331356b0db8572093d4a0512c11de7",
      "translationSHA256": "e82f88290ccc44f0fb0e7b711dd5f13de7f9fbba6ebb5ad9f2b82f7e58c5ea1c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
